msgid ""
"I consent to sharing my crop, leaf image, AI prediction, confidence, "
"symptoms, and relevant advisory with an agricultural expert for review. My "
"name, email, and exact location will not be shared."
msgstr ""
"Ninakubali kushiriki zao langu, picha ya jani, utabiri wa AI, ujasiri, "
"dalili, na ushauri unaohusika na mtaalamu wa kilimo kwa ukaguzi. Jina langu,"
" barua pepe, na eneo langu kamili halitashirikiwa."

msgid "Explicit consent is required to request an expert review."
msgstr "Idhini ya wazi inahitajika ili kuomba ukaguzi wa mtaalamu."

msgid ""
"You can share this case with an agricultural expert for a secondary "
"assessment. The expert will see your crop details, image, and the AI's "
"prediction."
msgstr ""
"Unaweza kushiriki kesi hii na mtaalamu wa kilimo kwa tathmini ya pili. "
"Mtaalamu ataona maelezo ya zao lako, picha, na utabiri wa AI."

